<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudanese armed forces have carried out drone strikes on markets in the disputed Abyei border region, killing more than 150 people in each attack. The strikes hit civilian gatherings, including mourners and a fuel market, causing hundreds of casualties. Communal clashes continue, with killings reported between Warrap and Lakes communities and arrests related to youth violence in Juba. Fresh attacks in Ruweng left nine dead and six wounded, and bodies arrived from the Khor Kaltan killings in Northern Bahr el Ghazal. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQN3U4cjBHVHNDQU90aGd6WTVBMHdRMkROQVpUMWFNdnBJS1ExY1dmdjlUdmxJTGswSFJqMnhRVnMwM0VPcHg3S0dDcldBaXo4a0preXY0SFBWZGdySDNRd25FTW5kTWg2THBYanhSNEFDUWlZMno2MzVOMEN5UVV6RUtScnU2X1hVTzduZDQ4dGNyUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZHdPdHJvbUlsMVFnY29MWXpHZHZJQjN6dXRoVW5vVmp0Qng5ZjItd25wZ014Y29EMGFOWDY1b1JWdV9lRTcyS21leHVzNUQ3aTRDMU5wLTlqUXhoYXRuTkNjZUVVTjF1dFYyMzNLM0tieU9VNWhVUzJILTdWT3MzQ3VUc3Y5cGkxVjhpN3hXcGZielpTU0xITVo4eVpnRUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPbG1vU0U0WS1EdmRtWE1Jd3ZfRC1kT3lwSW11NGQzelFIUWI2NURkT2VKaGtsZnEyWE94N1hiR3RfQThQbDhxb3hna19HRlhGUkVpOU5GRi1RZDBwekx1X2pnRnVRa2VCSEU3Q1ZWZUdudXBlUEU5ZUlDdW5RNENmY3ZKZ0xUUlZfX1J5c1EydXpjSzktdjgzZWl1dFMwaERqQ0d3bHhvbEwtNnZRWVZiQW4xTGMxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNVVRSM3dyWk9CNTlUcUJIemVkUGlYTGt4MUE2eTJCaDBXX2I4NGY2WUVsbDIySWdpSWcycVNXSXVVUzdEMnYyb2kzT3daTVRfdHh5S2tCbnpQVGJsUHVlRXh0MHdhMkVwcXE1M1AtSGFvZWtkTkN